{"2541950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sirens", "steam_appid": 2541950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5189600], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sirens</i></strong> is an underwater exploration and narrative-driven game where freedom of movement and <strong>emotional connection to the world matter more than checklists, quests, and numbers</strong>. Simply swimming and discovering secrets is not enough. <strong><u>We want the player to feel like a part of the ocean, to have a real impact on it, and to experience an environment that reacts to their actions in a natural, organic way.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/cf833e210ee233506727b6e5742c2bc9.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/cf833e210ee233506727b6e5742c2bc9.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/cf833e210ee233506727b6e5742c2bc9.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY OF SIRENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game concept is based on a theory in which the evolution of humanity was at some point diverged. The complex organism that chose to leave the ocean and conquer the lands was divided. Part of the species decided to stay in the water and evolve there. Perfecting their physical bodies, these beings began to exhibit more and more traits typical of marine creatures, giving rise to humanoid mermaids who never experienced life on land, evolving underwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/2c9451e2b76674d4c228e73ab5a2b209.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/2c9451e2b76674d4c228e73ab5a2b209.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/2c9451e2b76674d4c228e73ab5a2b209.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNDERWATER EVOLUTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Similar to humans on the surface, mermaids also dominated their environment, becoming the dominant species, free from diseases and wars. As long-lived beings, mermaids became increasingly perfect, more intelligent, and adept at hunting. Hiding from homo sapiens, concealing themselves in the depths of the ocean, in underwater caves, mermaids observe humanity, understanding that sooner or later, a confrontation will arise to determine the dominant species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/870ae516f1f69dd51b64194593815fba.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/870ae516f1f69dd51b64194593815fba.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/870ae516f1f69dd51b64194593815fba.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM PREHISTORY TO THE PRESENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fascinating journey through the world from the perspective of mermaids at different stages of their evolution. Feel the terror of the prehistoric world, the times of great floods, battling real and mythical creatures. Uncover the secrets hidden at the bottom of oceanic depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7cdae10c6ab04412d7cc524d05ceb5a5.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7cdae10c6ab04412d7cc524d05ceb5a5.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sirens</i> is not exclusively a peaceful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In moments of danger — to herself or to other peaceful species — the Siren transforms into a warrior. Her nature becomes aggressive, ruthless, and primal. She fights brutally and dynamically, reminding the ocean which species truly dominates the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This contrast between calm, meditative exploration and sudden, raw violence is one of the game’s core elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN HUB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trophies and found treasures will be used to modify your home. Decorate, customize, and tailor the visual aspect of the Main Hub to match your style. Let the mermaid feel comfortable in her cave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skins for your mermaid, admiring how her appearance and abilities change over millions of years of evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7e74d527c5b822cc2b99abe1130a303f.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7e74d527c5b822cc2b99abe1130a303f.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7e74d527c5b822cc2b99abe1130a303f.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Exploration of sea and ocean waters<br>-    Story Narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Main Hub customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Mermaid customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Combat using melee weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Boss battles</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sirens</i></strong> is an underwater exploration and narrative-driven game where freedom of movement and <strong>emotional connection to the world matter more than checklists, quests, and numbers</strong>. Simply swimming and discovering secrets is not enough. <strong><u>We want the player to feel like a part of the ocean, to have a real impact on it, and to experience an environment that reacts to their actions in a natural, organic way.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/cf833e210ee233506727b6e5742c2bc9.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/cf833e210ee233506727b6e5742c2bc9.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/cf833e210ee233506727b6e5742c2bc9.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY OF SIRENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game concept is based on a theory in which the evolution of humanity was at some point diverged. The complex organism that chose to leave the ocean and conquer the lands was divided. Part of the species decided to stay in the water and evolve there. Perfecting their physical bodies, these beings began to exhibit more and more traits typical of marine creatures, giving rise to humanoid mermaids who never experienced life on land, evolving underwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/2c9451e2b76674d4c228e73ab5a2b209.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/2c9451e2b76674d4c228e73ab5a2b209.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/2c9451e2b76674d4c228e73ab5a2b209.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNDERWATER EVOLUTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Similar to humans on the surface, mermaids also dominated their environment, becoming the dominant species, free from diseases and wars. As long-lived beings, mermaids became increasingly perfect, more intelligent, and adept at hunting. Hiding from homo sapiens, concealing themselves in the depths of the ocean, in underwater caves, mermaids observe humanity, understanding that sooner or later, a confrontation will arise to determine the dominant species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/870ae516f1f69dd51b64194593815fba.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/870ae516f1f69dd51b64194593815fba.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/870ae516f1f69dd51b64194593815fba.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM PREHISTORY TO THE PRESENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fascinating journey through the world from the perspective of mermaids at different stages of their evolution. Feel the terror of the prehistoric world, the times of great floods, battling real and mythical creatures. Uncover the secrets hidden at the bottom of oceanic depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7cdae10c6ab04412d7cc524d05ceb5a5.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7cdae10c6ab04412d7cc524d05ceb5a5.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sirens</i> is not exclusively a peaceful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In moments of danger — to herself or to other peaceful species — the Siren transforms into a warrior. Her nature becomes aggressive, ruthless, and primal. She fights brutally and dynamically, reminding the ocean which species truly dominates the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This contrast between calm, meditative exploration and sudden, raw violence is one of the game’s core elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN HUB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trophies and found treasures will be used to modify your home. Decorate, customize, and tailor the visual aspect of the Main Hub to match your style. Let the mermaid feel comfortable in her cave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skins for your mermaid, admiring how her appearance and abilities change over millions of years of evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7e74d527c5b822cc2b99abe1130a303f.poster.avif?t=1788255492\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7e74d527c5b822cc2b99abe1130a303f.webm?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/extras/7e74d527c5b822cc2b99abe1130a303f.mp4?t=1788255492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Exploration of sea and ocean waters<br>-    Story Narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Main Hub customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Mermaid customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Combat using melee weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-    Boss battles</p>", "short_description": "Become a deadly Siren and hunt down the most dangerous sea creatures that have ever swim in the depths of the oceans! Experience a fascinating journey through the world as seen from the perspective of Sirens at various stages of their evolution.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/26a350d6c164d348dadcdc6b89a500f22d91c1c6/header.jpg?t=1788255492", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/b0d9f09d178967e2f31c3634c00bf629331c442a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788255492", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541950/b0d9f09d178967e2f31c3634c00bf629331c442a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788255492", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.2 GHz, AMD Phenom II X4 955 - 4 Core, 3.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon R9 280 or Nvidia GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> system requirements may change during development of the game.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400, AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 580 or Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> system requirements may change during development of the game.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_req